# 50 — Search Queries

> Rust/Tauri-specific search patterns for AI agents navigating **{{project.name}}**.

## Find by Architectural Concern

| Concern | Search Pattern | Expected Location |
|---------|---------------|-------------------|
| Domain entities | `pub struct` in `*/entities/` | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain/src/entities/` |
| Value objects | `pub struct` in `*/values/` | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain/src/values/` |
| Domain services | `pub trait\|pub fn` in `*/services/` | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain/src/services/` |
| Application commands | `pub struct.*Command` | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-application/src/commands/` |
| Port traits | `pub trait` in `*/ports/` | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-application/src/ports/` |
| Port implementations | `impl.*for` in infrastructure | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-infrastructure/src/` |
| Tauri commands | `#[tauri::command]` | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-desktop/src/` |
| Database migrations | `CREATE TABLE\|ALTER TABLE` | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-infrastructure/src/database/` |
| Error types | `pub enum.*Error` | `*/errors.rs` in any crate |

## Find by Layer

| Layer | Glob Pattern |
|-------|-------------|
| Domain | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain/src/**/*.rs` |
| Application | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-application/src/**/*.rs` |
| Infrastructure | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-infrastructure/src/**/*.rs` |
| Desktop | `crates/{{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-desktop/src/**/*.rs` |
{{#if project.features.frontend}}
| Frontend | `frontend/src/**/*.ts` |
{{/if}}

## Find by Cross-Cutting Concern

| Concern | Search Pattern |
|---------|---------------|
| Logging | `tracing::\|#[instrument]` |
| Serialization | `#[derive(.*Serialize.*)]` |
| Error handling | `thiserror\|anyhow\|Result<` |
| Tests | `#[cfg(test)]\|#[test]` |
| SQLite queries | `rusqlite\|execute\|query_row` |
| Tauri state | `tauri::State\|manage(` |
